WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
Notes library. Saved notes include extracted concept labels.

00:01.000 --> 00:05.000
Note editor. The note content appears beside its key concepts.

00:05.000 --> 00:19.000
AI summary. Inspect the generated summary and extracted concepts.

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
Concept map. View connected ideas and inspect a node's source.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
Start review. Move into a recall session using the available concepts.

00:27.000 --> 00:33.400
Practice recall. Read a question, try an answer, and open the supporting reference.
